{"id":"3a43c0d6bea7","path":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/dual-choice","lang":"en","title":"A Dual Choice","description":"A bachelor's degree in communication prepares you both for a master's degree and a professional career. The choice is up to you.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Bachelor","BCOM","What after the Bachelor?"],"image":null,"words":93,"alternates":{"it":"/it/formazione/bachelor/comunicazione/prospettive/duplice-scelta","en":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/dual-choice"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Bachelor","path":"/en/originalnode/328"},{"label":"BCOM","path":"/en/education/bachelor/communication"},{"label":"What after the Bachelor?","path":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/master-studies"},{"label":"A Dual Choice","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Il Bachelor in Comunicazione prepara sia per un <a href=\"/it/originalnode/6822\">Master</a>, sia per una <a href=\"/it/originalnode/15881\">carriera professionale</a>.</p> <p>Il <strong>94,8%</strong> dei laureati del Bachelor in Comunicazione risultano essere <strong>occupati </strong>a 1 anno dal diploma.<br> Tre quarti (74%) hanno proseguito gli studi con un Master, mentre un quarto (26%) ha deciso di entrare nel mondo del lavoro. Il tempo medio per trovare un’occupazione è 2 mesi dal conseguimento del titolo.</p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td> <p><strong>Occupazione a 1 anno dalla laurea</strong></p> </td> <td> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>Occupati</p> </td> <td> <p>94.8%</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p><em>Prosegue studi</em></p> </td> <td> <p><em>74%</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p><em>Lavora</em></p> </td> <td> <p><em>26%</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>Tempo media ricerca impiego</p> </td> <td> <p>2 mesi</p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><em>Fonte: Indagine laureati USI Career Service 2018</em></p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Open Days","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/open-days-study-advisory"}],"nav":[{"label":"Bachelor in Communication","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication"},{"label":"Why Study Communication?","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/why-study-communication"},{"label":"Why Study Communication at USI?","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/why-study-communication/why-study-communication-at-usi"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/node/35553"},{"label":"Dual Choice","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/dual-choice"},{"label":"Continue the Studies with a Master’s","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/master-studies"},{"label":"Entering the Business World","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/career-prospects"},{"label":"Admission","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/admission"},{"label":"Fees and grants","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/contacts"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/dual-choice","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:24:48.469Z"}